sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Analyst
  participant UI as Dashboard UI
  participant API as /api/chat
  participant A as ChatAssistant
  participant RR as RuleResponder
  participant ST as AiSettingsStore
  participant P as LlmProvider (Gemini / Groq)

  U->>UI: "What is CSRF?"
  UI->>API: POST /api/chat {message}
  API->>A: reply(message)
  A->>RR: answer(message)
  RR-->>A: None (no rule matches)
  A->>ST: resolve()
  ST-->>A: provider, model, key (Settings page > .env > default)
  alt key set and under 10 AI calls per minute
    A->>P: complete(key, model, system prompt + summary numbers, question)
    P-->>A: answer text
    A-->>API: (answer, "ai")
  else no key, quota used, or provider error
    A-->>API: (help text, "rules")
  end
  API-->>UI: {reply, source}
  UI-->>U: plain-text bubble
